        "en": "Film: La La Land. Written and directed by Damien Chazelle, 2016.\n\nFilm: The Umbrellas of Cherbourg. Written and directed by Jacques Demy, 1964.\n\nScreenplay consulted: Damien Chazelle, [La La Land](https://imsdb.com/scripts/La-La-Land.html). IMSDb.\n\n[1] Nate Sloan. [“La La Land’s Oscar-winning ‘City of Stars’ collapses the film’s entire plot into 2.5 minutes.”](https://www.vox.com/culture/2017/2/28/14754040/city-of-stars-la-la-land-best-song-oscar) Vox, 28 February 2017.\n\n[2] Noah Gittell. [“The La La Land backlash: why have critics turned on the Oscar favorite?”](https://www.theguardian.com/film/2017/feb/06/la-la-land-criticism-race-gender-jazz-awards) The Guardian, 6 February 2017.",
        "fr": "Film : La La Land. Scénario et réalisation : Damien Chazelle, 2016.\n\nFilm : Les Parapluies de Cherbourg. Scénario et réalisation : Jacques Demy, 1964.\n\nScénario consulté : Damien Chazelle, [La La Land](https://imsdb.com/scripts/La-La-Land.html). IMSDb.\n\n[1] Nate Sloan. [« La La Land’s Oscar-winning ‘City of Stars’ collapses the film’s entire plot into 2.5 minutes. »](https://www.vox.com/culture/2017/2/28/14754040/city-of-stars-la-la-land-best-song-oscar) Vox, 28 février 2017.\n\n[2] Noah Gittell. [« The La La Land backlash: why have critics turned on the Oscar favorite? »](https://www.theguardian.com/film/2017/feb/06/la-la-land-criticism-race-gender-jazz-awards) The Guardian, 6 février 2017.",
